// A cave rat that bends (a prototype beside `rat.ron`): the same art, its
// tail left off (a chain now, swinging behind) and drawn by its spine
// (`body::spine`): its head, then its body cut in slices from the shoulders
// back, each laid along the way its head went. Its box is its head's: the
// frame's feet under the middle of its head. Facing right; the game
// mirrors it.
